  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Carbon OpenTelemetry spans",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Carbon emits manual spans around the ingest pipeline and provider calls in addition to the auto-instrumented HTTP / Fastify / ioredis / pg spans. Use the links above to jump into Jaeger or Tempo.\n\n### Ingestion pipeline\n- `ingest.pipeline` — root span for the sync + async ingest flow\n- `ingest.parse` — parser adapter (OpenAPI / Postman / HAR / …)\n- `ingest.infer.resources` — AI resource inference\n- `ingest.infer.relationships` — AI relationship inference\n- `ingest.judge` — LLM-as-judge quality gate\n- `ingest.build_graph` — resource-graph builder\n- `ingest.persist` — Postgres + storage writes\n\n### AI provider calls\n- `ai.complete` with attributes `ai.provider`, `ai.model`, `ai.prompt_tokens`, `ai.completion_tokens`\n\nSet `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` on the API pod to enable export. See `DEPLOY.md` for vendor snippets."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "AI provider call rate (from metrics)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(carbon_usage_recorded_total{kind=~\"ai.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Ingest job duration histogram",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(carbon_ingest_job_duration_ms_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(carbon_ingest_job_duration_ms_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" } }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
